5,0,1,talk,Kenji,,Hi everyone! Let's all work together to find the werewolf. I'm excited to play!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Shion,,Let's keep it logical. Emotional outbursts won't help us find the wolf.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,Agreed. We should observe each other's patterns before jumping to conclusions.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Servas,,"Patience is a virtue, my friends. Let us approach this with open hearts and clear minds.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Yumi,,Hello everyone! I'm so happy to be here with you all! Let's do our best and have fun!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Shion, you seem very serious! Do you have a plan for how we should find the werewolf?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Shion,,Simply observing who is trying too hard to blend in or who is leading the charge too aggressively.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,That is a reasonable approach. I will be watching for inconsistencies in everyone's statements.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Servas,,It is often in the quietest moments that the truth reveals itself. Let us listen to one another.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Yumi,,I agree with Servas! Let's be kind to each other while we search for the wolf!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Kenji,,I'll do my best to help! I wonder who the werewolf is... it's like a big puzzle!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Shion,,A puzzle indeed. Though some pieces are more obvious than others if you know where to look.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,pass,Ryuji,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""norm"":[{""code"":""pass_punct"",""token"":""Skip"",""raw"":""Skip.""}],""raw"":""Skip.""}"
18,0,3,talk,Servas,,"Life is a series of puzzles, Kenji. The joy is not just in the answer, but in the search.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Yumi,,"Hehe, you're so poetic, Servas! I'm sure we can solve this puzzle together!","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
