31,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"Everyone, listen! I have a secret... Shion is the werewolf! I know it for sure!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Shion,,"@Kenji, that's a bold claim for the first day. Do you have evidence, or are you just guessing?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"@Kenji, claiming someone is the werewolf without any evidence is an irrational move. Why would you do that?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Servas,,"Let us not let anger cloud our judgment. Kenji, please tell us why you feel this way.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"Oh no! Kenji-kun, are you sure? Let's all stay calm and talk it through!","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Kenji,,I'm the Seer! I checked Shion last night and found out he's the werewolf! Trust me!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Shion,,"A classic bluff. If I were the werewolf, I wouldn't be this calm. You're likely the wolf trying to frame me.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"If Kenji is the Seer, we should execute Shion. But if Kenji is the wolf, he's trying to eliminate a human.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Servas,,"Truth can be a heavy burden. If you are the Seer, Kenji, your courage in speaking up is admirable.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"Wow, the Seer is already among us! If Kenji-kun is telling the truth, we have to trust him!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"I'm not lying! I really want us to win! Please, let's vote for Shion!","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Ryuji, @Servas, think logically. A real Seer might wait to gather more information. Kenji is too eager.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Servas"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"Shion's point is valid. However, the risk of leaving a werewolf alive is higher than the risk of executing a villager.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Servas,,"In the journey of life, we must sometimes make difficult choices based on the information we have.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Yumi,,I want to believe Kenji-kun! He seems so sincere and energetic about it!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Kenji,,Please believe me! Let's get rid of the werewolf right now!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Shion,,I'll leave it to the others. My logic is sound; the rest is up to your intuition.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I have analyzed the situation. Kenji's claim is direct. I will follow the Seer's lead for now.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Servas,,I shall cast my vote with a hopeful heart that we are moving toward the light of truth.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Yumi,,I'm voting for Shion-san! Let's save the village together!,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
